    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Human Lineage.</strong> The branch that kept the strength. Heavy bone, deep lung, the ancestor who decided that an ice age is a problem you out-mass.</p><p><em>“The map says ‘stop.’ You keep walking. Slower. Heavier. The map gives up first.”</em></p><p><strong>Neanderthal.</strong> You are the broad lineage that survived by being the thing the cold couldn’t finish.</p><h3>Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid.</li><li><strong>Size.</strong> Medium.</li><li><strong>Lineage Lean.</strong> Your lineage leans toward <strong>VIO</strong>—expressed primarily through Tier powers.</li><li><strong>Endurance Frame.</strong> You count as one size larger for the purposes of carrying capacity, push, drag, and lift.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
